iption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-15T07:45:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T12:13:11Z","closed_at":"2025-11-16T11:59:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducable in: 4.5, 4.5.1, 4.5.2-rc, 4.4\nNot reproducable in: 4.3\n\nThe bug is tested only on Windows and Linux. While Windows have this issue, it is not encountered on Linux.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated Radeon RX550/550 Series (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD FX(tm)-8350 Eight-Core Processor (8 threads) - 15.89 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the controller is connected before the game starts, it triggers `joy_connection_changed` signal and is present on `get_connected_joypads`. If it is disconnected, it triggers `joy_connection_changed` and is removed from `get_connected_joypads`.\n\nBut if it is connected after the game is started, it does not trigger `joy_connection_changed` and the device is not visible on `get_connected_joypads`. The same goes for disconnection as well.\n\nLike mentioned above, this issue does not occur on Linux.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee *Issue descrition*.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gamepad-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23559605/gamepad-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Brogolem35","id":29329606,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzI5NjA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29329606?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35","html_url":"https://github.com/Brogolem35","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brogolem35/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112802/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112802/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}